BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Build a Financial Plan that Grows with You Workshop
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260611T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260611T200000
UID:0edc595191b2f447b52d1cef9e5e33fa@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Are you ready to take control of your financial future? Join M
 ary Jo Kerrigan\, Financial Advisor with Equitable Advisors\, for a Financ
 ial Planning Workshop designed to help you build confidence around your mo
 ney and create a plan that grows with you. We will discuss how to: Set cle
 ar priorities and create actionable financial goals Define your vision for
  what financial success looks like to you Plan effectively as an individua
 l or as part of a couple Understand the key elements of a comprehensive fi
 nancial plan Navigate income and expense fluctuations with confidence Disc
 over the value of working with a professional to stay on track Walk away w
 ith practical insights and a flexible framework designed to grow with you.
URL:https://business.northessexchamber.com/events/details/build-a-financia
 l-plan-that-grows-with-you-workshop
X-SOURCE:North Essex Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
